{"synopsis":"Ning Tian datang ke Dunia Tianxuan sebagai orang yang tidak berguna, tetapi entah bagaimana dia berhasil masuk ke kamar Permaisuri dan Permaisuri Luo yang sangat cantik berencana untuk menikah dengannya malam ini?! Terkejut! Sistem diaktifkan! Dia bisa mendapatkan hadiah dengan mengejutkan orang lain?! Permulaannya mengejutkan Permaisuri dan itu adalah langkah pertama baginya untuk mencapai tujuannya mengejutkan seluruh dunia! Ning Tian melihat keajaiban yang tak terhitung jumlahnya dan berkata, “Tidak mungkin… Saya hanya berkultivasi dengan santai dan kalian sudah terkejut dengan hal itu?","alternative_title":"开局震惊女帝老婆，我无敌了","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"53a48138-7810-4cc6-8eb9-181a91ff3cae","number":"122","chapter":"122","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"16220782-42e5-477e-a06a-5dc4ec43b439","number":"121","chapter":"121","title":"","date":"2026-07-20","released":"2026-07-20"},{"chapter_id":"f24d737b-602d-4644-a7bf-3d3604060aff","number":"120","chapter":"120","title":"","date":"2026-07-12","released":"2026-07-12"},{"chapter_id":"19202e35-0540-443d-88f6-be931fec7bae","number":"119","chapter":"119","title":"","date":"2026-07-12","released":"2026-07-12"},{"chapter_id":"a06ed140-c389-42fc-8e44-01ee0704d095","number":"118","chapter":"118","title":"","date":"2026-07-09","released":"2026-07-09"},{"chapter_id":"cae67ed5-e12f-4886-ae42-0cd3b801ae4f","number":"117","chapter":"117","title":"","date":"2026-07-09","released":"2026-07-09"},{"chapter_id":"6f12a277-97cd-45c0-8254-b1fd4261698b","number":"116","chapter":"116","title":"","date":"2026-07-01","released":"2026-07-01"},{"chapter_id":"5ac0c4e0-8e52-468e-a2a8-08094b55d173","number":"115","chapter":"115","title":"","date":"2026-06-15","released":"2026-06-15"},{"chapter_id":"c74d844d-195f-4856-a8c9-759177876fde","number":"114","chapter":"114","title":"","date":"2026-06-03","released":"2026-06-03"},{"chapter_id":"76aad864-e9d1-4a68-9042-a1